<title>USA: Greenville Area SD, Pa., won by RRZ Public Markets.</title>
<headline>Greenville Area SD, Pa., won by RRZ Public Markets.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>RRZ Public Markets said it won $8 million of Greenville Area School District , Pa., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 5.349 percent.</p>
